{"text":"kuruntokai","n":35,"lines":["நாணில மன்றவெங் கண்ணே நாணேர்பு","சினைப்பசும் பாம்பின் சூன்முதிர்ப் பன்ன","கனைத்த கரும்பின் கூம்புபொதி யவிழ","நுண்ணுறை யழிதுளி தலைஇய","தண்வரல் வாடையும் பிரிந்திசினோர்க் கழலே"],"tr":["nāṇila maṉṟaveṅ kaṇṇē nāṇērpu","ciṉaippacum pāmpiṉ cūṉmutirp paṉṉa","kaṉaitta karumpiṉ kūmpupoti yaviḻa","nuṇṇuṟai yaḻituḷi talaiiya","taṇvaral vāṭaiyum pirinticiṉōrk kaḻalē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கழார்க்கீரனெயிற்றி","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kaḻārkkīraṉeyiṟṟi"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 8, āciriyattaḷai 6, kalittaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நாணில","tr":"nāṇila","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணில","tr":"ṇila"}]},{"text":"மன்றவெங்","tr":"maṉṟaveṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவெங்","tr":"ṟaveṅ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]},{"text":"நாணேர்பு","tr":"nāṇērpu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணேர்","tr":"ṇēr"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பு","tr":"pu"}]}],[{"text":"சினைப்பசும்","tr":"ciṉaippacum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சினைப்","tr":"ciṉaip"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசும்","tr":"pacum"}]},{"text":"பாம்பின்","tr":"pāmpiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பாம்","tr":"pām"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]},{"text":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","tr":"cūṉmutirp","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூன்","tr":"cūṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முதிர்ப்","tr":"mutirp"}]},{"text":"பன்ன","tr":"paṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]}],[{"text":"கனைத்த","tr":"kaṉaitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கனைத்","tr":"kaṉait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"கரும்பின்","tr":"karumpiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரும்","tr":"karum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]},{"text":"கூம்புபொதி","tr":"kūmpupoti","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூம்","tr":"kūm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புபொ","tr":"pupo"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]},{"text":"யவிழ","tr":"yaviḻa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யவி","tr":"yavi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழ","tr":"ḻa"}]}],[{"text":"நுண்ணுறை","tr":"nuṇṇuṟai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நுண்","tr":"nuṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுறை","tr":"ṇuṟai"}]},{"text":"யழிதுளி","tr":"yaḻituḷi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யழி","tr":"yaḻi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துளி","tr":"tuḷi"}]},{"text":"தலைஇய","tr":"talaiiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]}],[{"text":"தண்வரல்","tr":"taṇvaral","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரல்","tr":"varal"}]},{"text":"வாடையும்","tr":"vāṭaiyum","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"பிரிந்திசினோர்க்","tr":"pirinticiṉōrk","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரிந்","tr":"pirin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திசி","tr":"tici"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோர்க்","tr":"ṉōrk"}]},{"text":"கழலே","tr":"kaḻalē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழ","tr":"kaḻa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நாணில","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"modesty"},{"text":"இல","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"they do not have"}],"gloss":"they have no modesty"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"surely"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eyes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"eyes indeed"},{"surface":"நாணேர்பு","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"modesty"},{"text":"ஏர்பு","lemma":"ஏர்பு","gloss":"rising/holding"}],"gloss":"holding onto modesty"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சினைப்பசும்","parts":[{"text":"சினை","lemma":"சினை","gloss":"pregnant"},{"text":"பசும்","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"green"}],"gloss":"pregnant green"},{"surface":"பாம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பு","lemma":"பாம்பு","gloss":"snake"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the snake"},{"surface":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","parts":[{"text":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","lemma":"சூன்முதிர்ப்","gloss":"maturing pregnancy"}],"gloss":"maturing pregnancy","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கனைத்த","parts":[{"text":"கனைத்த","lemma":"கனை","gloss":"grown thick"}],"gloss":"thickly grown"},{"surface":"கரும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பு","lemma":"கரும்பு","gloss":"sugarcane"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the sugarcane"},{"surface":"கூம்புபொதி","parts":[{"text":"கூம்பு","lemma":"கூம்பு","gloss":"closed"},{"text":"பொதி","lemma":"பொதி","gloss":"sheath"}],"gloss":"closed sheath"},{"surface":"அவிழ","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"to open"}],"gloss":"to open"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நுண்ணுறை","parts":[{"text":"நுண்","lemma":"நுண்மை","gloss":"fine"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"drizzle"}],"gloss":"fine drizzle"},{"surface":"அழிதுளி","parts":[{"text":"அழி","lemma":"அழி","gloss":"abundant"},{"text":"துளி","lemma":"துளி","gloss":"drop"}],"gloss":"heavy drops"},{"surface":"தலைஇய","parts":[{"text":"தலைஇய","lemma":"தலைஇய","gloss":"having showered"}],"gloss":"having showered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்வரல்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்மை","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"வருதல்","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"cool coming"},{"surface":"வாடையும்","parts":[{"text":"வாடை","lemma":"வாடை","gloss":"north wind"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the north wind"},{"surface":"பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"பிரிந்து","lemma":"பிரி","gloss":"having parted"},{"text":"இசினோர்","lemma":"இசினோர்","gloss":"those who"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to those who have parted"},{"surface":"அழலே","parts":[{"text":"அழல்","lemma":"அழல்","gloss":"fire"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is fire indeed"}]}],"literal":"They have no modesty surely, my eyes, [even when] holding onto modesty / Like the mature pregnancy of a pregnant green snake / The closed sheath of the thick sugarcane opens / Fine drizzle and heavy drops having showered / The cool-coming north wind, to those who have parted, is fire indeed.","translation":"My eyes surely have no modesty. Even when I try to hold onto my modesty, they weep. The cool north wind, which brings fine drizzle and heavy drops that make the closed sheaths of the thick sugarcane—looking like the mature pregnancy of a green snake—burst open, is like fire to those who are separated from their lovers.","modern":"என் கண்கள் நிச்சயமாக நாணமற்றவை. நான் நாணத்தைக் காக்க முயன்றாலும் அவை கண்ணீர் விடுகின்றன. முதிர்ந்த கருவைக் கொண்ட பச்சைப் பாம்பைப் போன்ற, பருத்த கரும்பின் மூடிய மொட்டுகள் அவிழ்ந்து மலருமாறு, நுண்ணிய தூறலையும் பெருந்துளிகளையும் பொழிகின்ற, குளிர்ச்சியாக வீசும் வாடைக் காற்றானது, தம் காதலரைப் பிரிந்திருப்பவருக்கு நெருப்பைப் போன்றதாகும்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her companion in deep distress during the cold season. Her lover has not returned as promised, and she is struggling to hide her grief. She laments that her eyes have lost all modesty because they weep openly, revealing her secret pain to everyone. The poem features a vivid image of sugarcane sheaths, swollen like a pregnant green snake, bursting open under the cold rain. This natural image mirrors the heroine's own state, where her tightly guarded secret of separation is forced open by the cold north wind, which feels not cool, but like a burning fire to her.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.57],[0.57,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,4.01],[4.01,4.5],[4.5,4.68],[4.8,6.2],[6.2,6.4],[6.4,7.2],[7.28,7.5],[7.66,8.8],[8.88,9.22],[9.22,9.3],[9.3,10.94],[11.12,11.3],[11.43,11.97],[11.97,12.37]],"female":[[0.0,0.64],[0.64,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.0],[3.25,4.0],[4.0,4.4],[4.4,5.28],[5.28,5.4],[5.4,6.8],[6.8,7.0],[7.0,8.0],[8.1,8.4],[8.6,10.0],[10.2,11.0],[11.0,11.2],[11.2,12.75],[12.85,13.1],[13.1,13.73],[13.8,14.4]]},"sync":[[["நாணில","they have no modesty"]],[["மன்ற","surely"],["எம்","my"]],[["கண்ணே","eyes indeed"]],[["நாணேர்பு","holding onto modesty"]],[["சினைப்பசும்","pregnant green"]],[["பாம்பின்","of the snake"]],[["சூன்முதிர்ப்","maturing pregnancy"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["கனைத்த","thickly grown"]],[["கரும்பின்","of the sugarcane"]],[["கூம்புபொதி","closed sheath"]],[["அவிழ","to open"]],[["நுண்ணுறை","fine drizzle"]],[["அழிதுளி","heavy drops"]],[["தலைஇய","having showered"]],[["தண்வரல்","cool coming"]],[["வாடையும்","and the north wind"]],[["பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","to those who have parted"]],[["பிரிந்திசினோர்க்கு","to those who have parted"],["அழலே","is fire indeed"]]]}